    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds good in theory but it doesnt feel like that. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging them down. every time i fail, i can see the disappointment in my father's eyes. it's like... if i wasn't here, the pattern of failure stops. the shame stops. wouldn't it be better if the legacy stayed pure instead of being dragged through my mistakes?",
